# The Breeds of the Ring

**who you are —** The Breeds of the Ring — The Hominids of the Ring of Ringworld

**what you do —** A thousand hominid species evolved across three million Earths — Machine People, Hanging People, Grass Giants, Vampires, Reds — humanity's cousins, each gone strange in its own long isolation.

**where you belong —** The Hominids of the Ring · humanity's cousins, gone strange across three million Earths

